        "description": "Returns a student's aggregated academic performance for a term.\n\nIncludes per-subject weighted percentages (accounting for sitting weights\nif configured), grade letters, remarks, and trend indicators compared\nto the previous term.\n\nThe overall trend and per-subject trends feed directly into the\nMoozo insights engine to detect students who may need support.\n",
