        "description": "Only the staff member who logged the incident, or OWNER/ADMIN, can update it.\n\nAll fields are optional — only provided fields are updated.\n\nTo resolve a follow-up incident set `resolutionStatus: RESOLVED` and\nprovide `followUpNotes` describing what was done.\n\nTo mark the parent as notified set `parentNotified: true`.\n",
